  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      393.6,
      297.65,
      451.67
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land whichis required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      103.92,
      460.8,
      264.32,
      470.87
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      477.6,
      297.34,
      511.67
    ],
    "text": "Public purpose means the land Acquisition for the landwhere Ambanganga Korale Divisional Secretariat issituated.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      525.6,
      297.55,
      607.67
    ],
    "text": "The land called Opalgala Estate, containing in extent0.3744 Hectare, depicted as lot A shown in P.P.Ma. 1729,prepared by Surveyor General dated on 23.08.2018, situatedat Palletenna village, in Palletenna Grama NiladhariDivision, Ambanganga Korale minor Division ofAmbanganga Korale Divisional Secretary's Division,Matale District, Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      621.65,
      297.95,
      655.67
    ],
    "text": "Lot ANorth: Palletenna Estate where Ambanganga KoraleEducation Office is situated, Road Development Authority",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.8,
      321.12,
      562.14,
      403.19
    ],
    "text": "road, Pradeshiya Sabha road; East: Road DevelopmentAuthority road and road; South: Road and Palletenna Estateclaimed by S. Sivakumar and others; West: Road andPalletenna Estate claimed by S. Sivakumar and others andPalletenna Estate where Ambanganga Korale Education Officeis situated; Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.3744Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.8,
      417.12,
      562.21,
      463.19
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents before me at 10.00a.m. on the 21st day of December 2018 at the AmbangangaKorale Divisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.8,
      477.12,
      561.95,
      547.19
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 14th day of December2018, the nature of their interests in the Land, the particularsof their claims for compensation for the acquisition of thesaid land, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
